    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are a descendant of loupain that lived in colder climes, and as a result you have a larger body with thicker fur. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Fortitude DC or Reflex DC against attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.lOE4yjUnETTdaf2T]{Reposition}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.7blmbDrQFNfdT731]{Shove} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{Trip} you. This applies to saving throws against spells or effects that attempt a similar effect. If the Shove or Trip action fails and the initiating creature is one size larger than you or smaller, it is considered @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to you until the end of your next turn.</span></p>"
